    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi kabyabaire byahoire, Omukama Ahasuero akuza Hamani Omuagagi mutabani wa Hamedata. Amukuza, amuha obukuru ashaga abatwazi batahibe bona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaramata bona b'Omukama abaikaraga aha kihigi ky'Omukama babandamira Hamani, bamuramya; Omukama akaba aragiire kabamugira batyo. Kyonkai Moridekai tiyamubandamiire anga kumuramya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abaramata b'Omukama abaikaraga aha kihigi ky'Omukama babaza Moridekai bati, “Kubaki nochwa omuhango gw'Omukama?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabamugambiire buli kiro atabahuliliize, bagambira Hamani, babone ebigambo bya Moridekai ekyo biragasha; kuba Moridekai akaba abagambire okwo ali Muyahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani kayaboine okwo Moridekai atalikumubandamira anga kumuramya, anigara muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abona kumwita wenkai tikilikumara. Nobona bakaba bamumanyisize eihangalye. Kityo ahiga kwita Abayahudi bona, eihanga lya Moridekai, omu ngoma ya Ahasuero yona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwezi gwa mbere ogwetwa Nisani, omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ebili Omukama Ahasuero aliire engoma, buli kiro Hamani yayetaga abateeki b'enshoga, enshoga ezo bazetaga Puri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Puri",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Anga Purimu bikahinduka biro bikuru by'Abayahudi kwijuka okurokoka kwabo omu mikono ya Hamani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " baragura buli mwezi kulemwa kuhika omwezi gwa ikumi n'ebili ogwetwa Adari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Hamani agambira Omukama Ahasuero ati, “Haliho eihanga limoi elyenaganagire, lyemalire omu mahanga omu mikoa yona omu ngoma yawe. Amateka gabo tigalikushushana ga bantu bandi. Tibalikuhikya mateka gawe, aha rw'ekyo tikilikugasha mukama kubatwalizamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'oraba noyenda ohange babasilikye. Ab'araragira omulimo ogu inye ndabashashura etani 340 z'efeza bazite buhanika y'Omukama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Omukama ajura empetaye y'omuhuri agiha Hamani Omuagagi mutabani wa Hamedata, omubisha w'Abayahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amugambira ati, “Empiya ezo nazikuha, n'eihanga elyo nalikuha, obagire nk'okwo orayenda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho aha kiro kya ikumi na bishatu ky'omwezi gwa mbere beta abahandiki b'Omukama. Omuku guhandikwa nk'okwo Hamani yaragiire. Baguhandikira abagavana bona abatwaraga buli mukoa n'abatwazi b'amahanga gona, buli mukoa omu mihandikire yagwo, na buli ihanga omu rulimi rwalyo. Baguhandika omw'ibara ly'Omukama Ahasuero, bagumaamisa empetaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebarua bazitweka abatarishi omu mikoa y'Omukama yona, kusilikya Abayahudi bona, abato n'abakuru, abakazi n'abana ekiro kimoi, nikyo kiro kya ikumi na bishatu ky'omwezi gwa ikumi n'ebili ogwetwa Adari, n'okubanyaga ebyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekopi y'omuku ogwo eragirwa kuturuka guli muku omuli buli mukoa, kurangira amahanga gona kwetekatekera ekiro ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatarishi bahulira omuhango gw'Omukama, bagenda bwangu, n'omuku gwonene guturuka omu kigo kya Susa. Omukama na Hamani bombili bashuntama banywa; kyonkai ekigo kya Susa kishoberwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
